# Client environment variables
#
# In development the client uses Vite's built-in proxy (vite.config.ts) to
# forward /api and /socket.io requests to the server. No environment variables
# are required for local development.
#
# If you deploy the client separately from the server, set this variable so
# the client knows where to reach the API. It is NOT used in the default
# Vite dev setup.
VITE_API_URL=https://your-api-domain.com/api
